{"s": {"beats": [], "code": "cam = thing(\"video_camera\", x=-3.5, h=3.0, color=CREAM)\nenter(cam, \"draw\")\ncamera(zoom=1.3, to=(-3.5, 0.2))\nsfx(\"pop\")\n\nwhen(\"tiny 2% cut\")\ncamera(zoom=1.0, to=(-1.8, 0.2))\npts = thing(\"trophy\", x=0.0, h=2.8, color=CREAM)\nenter(pts, \"draw\")\ncut_txt = text(\"2%\", x=0.0, y=2.3, style=\"number\", color=CREAM)\nplay(Create(cut_txt), run_time=0.5, sound=\"ding\")\ncamera(zoom=1.25, to=(0.0, 0.2))\n\nwhen(\"millions straight into their bank account\")\ncamera(zoom=1.0, to=(1.5, 0.3))\nb = thing(\"bank\", x=3.0, h=3.5, color=CREAM)\nenter(b, \"draw\")\nflow(pts, b, item=\"gold_bar\", n=8)\npile(\"coin\", n=8, x=3.0, size=0.55)\nmil = text(\"$0M\", x=3.0, y=2.5, style=\"number\", color=CREAM)\nplay(Create(mil), run_time=0.5, sound=\"coin\")\ncount(mil, to=10, frm=0, prefix=\"$\", suffix=\"M\", dur=1.0)\ncamera(zoom=1.25, to=(3.0, 0.3))\n", "duration": 12.8, "narration": "Compare that to a movie star who negotiates backend points, where a tiny 2% cut of box office tickets sends millions straight into their bank account. Video game contracts rarely share the upside like that.", "objects": [{"id": "n0", "obj": "video_camera"}, {"id": "n1", "obj": "trophy"}, {"id": "n2", "obj": "bank"}, {"id": "n3", "obj": "gold_bar"}, {"id": "n4", "obj": "coin"}], "theme": "visual", "words": [["Compare", 0.0], ["that", 0.42], ["to", 0.62], ["a", 0.8], ["movie", 0.88], ["star", 1.12], ["who", 1.42], ["negotiates", 1.66], ["backend", 2.28], ["points,", 2.64], ["where", 3.48], ["a", 3.66], ["tiny", 3.66], ["2%", 4.04], ["cut", 4.64], ["of", 4.8], ["box", 5.0], ["office", 5.26], ["tickets", 5.62], ["sends", 5.98], ["millions", 6.3], ["straight", 6.66], ["into", 7.1], ["their", 7.32], ["bank", 7.5], ["account.", 7.68], ["Video", 8.74], ["game", 8.92], ["contracts", 9.26], ["rarely", 9.8], ["share", 10.16], ["the", 10.54], ["upside", 10.7], ["like", 10.96], ["that.", 11.28]]}, "script": 1, "v": true}